      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.28. Revenue: ₹54.7m (down 1.5% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹342.0k (up 62% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.6% (up from 0.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 64% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 1% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
